<title>CHINA: Krupp $1.4b Shanghai plant to be signed by May.</title>
<headline>Krupp $1.4b Shanghai plant to be signed by May.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The contract for a $1.4 billion stainless steel plant in Shanghai, 60 percent owned by Germany's Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch-Krupp, will be signed before May, company officials said on Monday.</p>
